      "proposed_content": "Theorem 1 turns its three analytic hypotheses into a convolution-stable interface: after an appropriate seed is verified, convolution powers generate further equidistributed sequences, instantiated here by the constant-one seed for higher divisor functions and by iterated Bombieri input for restricted prime-product indicators.",
